{
  "meta": {
    "about": "Change layer for the Oranim junction mini-app (junction.html). Each changeset is toggled on/off in the UI. The changeset flagged isFinalPlan:true is driven by the Today/Final master toggle; the rest are independent experimental scenarios. Mutations compose on top of data/junction_graph.json (base OSM graph) in array order.",
    "source": "2026.07.02 אורנים תצורה חדשה - שיתוף ציבור (Dan Ben Amram / צוות תכנית אב לתחבורה ירושלים)",
    "ops": [
      "addNode",
      "addEdge",
      "removeEdge",
      "modifyEdge",
      "setOneway",
      "addTurnRestriction",
      "removeTurnRestriction"
    ],
    "turnSpec": "addTurnRestriction accepts EITHER concrete {fromEdge,viaNode,toEdge} OR semantic {viaNode,fromName,fromSide,toName,toSide} resolved in the client against the graph. type: no_left_turn|no_right_turn|no_turn|no_u_turn|only_*",
    "notes_pending_precise_ids": "Bans #2 (איסור שמאלה ל'פארק המסילה' 34), #3 (איסור שמאלה מ'פארק המסילה' צפונה/מערבה), #4 (ביטול שמאלה ממקור חיים צפונה/מערבה) and #7 (שינוי גישת תחנת דלק) still need their exact OSM edge ids pinned via the in-app DebugOverlay (they touch road-34/park and the fuel-station apron, which are ambiguous in OSM). Bans #1/#5/#6 + two-way + the new connector below are pinned to real ids."
  },
